<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 12.5 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     5.99	(6.73)    98.48	  (98.35)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.35	(6.84)    96.88	  (96.70)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.86	(6.74)    93.55	  (93.70)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on February 25.</p>
</text>
